## Transitive components (copyright headers preserved in-file)

Vendored files additionally contain code from, or derived from:
HuggingFace Transformers (Apache-2.0), Qwen (Apache-2.0), OpenGVLab InternVL
(MIT), Meta Platforms VGGT / SAM (Apache-2.0), Black Forest Labs, and
Stability AI (Stable Diffusion 3.5 MMDiT-X, used by the LatentUM decoder).

## Evaluated models (no code copied)

The toolkit also evaluates checkpoints/APIs of: Qwen2/2.5/3-VL, InternVL3/3.5,
GLM-4.6V, Step3-VL, MiMo-Embodied, ThinkMorph, and the Gemini / Qwen-Plus APIs.
These are acknowledged in the README; no code from these projects is vendored.
